  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> All variable, numeric effects of a talent modified by this metamagic are maximized. Saving throws and opposed rolls are not affected, nor are talents without random variables. An empowered, maximized talent gains the separate benefits of each feat: the maximum result plus half the normally rolled result.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +3 spell points</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
